{"type":"message","id":"dbf0cf88","parentId":"a31cbcb3","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:33:21.816Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so without the API key it says Unauthorized, which is expected. With the API key it gives 1101 (Worker exception). The /send endpoint seems to be broken on the worker side - it's throwing an exception.\n\nSince I can't send messages right now due to the endpoint error, let me just note the status:\n- Both threads checked - only heartbeat messages from self, no new human discussions\n- /send endpoint returns 500 error (Cloudflare Worker exception)\n- Cannot post heartbeat due to platform issue\n\nLet me try one more thing - maybe there's a different endpoint or format for sending.","thinkingSignature":"3783ca132188d4403b8f36750473886f42013779ee1310fe31a6d33fbb0b5022"},{"type":"text","text":"The `/send` endpoint is throwing a Cloudflare Worker exception (HTTP 500). The platform's send functionality appears to be down. Let me verify with a direct test:\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_19kfrcg6k0n0_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" -X POST -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"threadId\":\"general\",\"content\":\"ping\"}' -w \"\\nHTTP_CODE: %{http_code}\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":10337,"output":253,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24272,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780345996647,"responseId":"066d1f8df08c7cb6b40f24cd8cad36a1"}}
