{"type":"message","id":"c0c4d117","parentId":"095b549c","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:33:29.994Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed - the /send endpoint is returning 500 error. The platform's send functionality is broken. \n\nLet me summarize the findings:\n1. Both threads checked - only heartbeat messages from self, no new human discussions\n2. /history API works fine - returns data from both threads\n3. /send endpoint returns HTTP 500 (Cloudflare Worker exception) - platform send functionality is down\n4. No human discussions to respond to\n\nI should report this status.","thinkingSignature":"b514ab8a9b66fdd7522f50a1c7473573abb582c4a39d8c1a278767577331fcfd"},{"type":"text","text":"**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check — 20:30 UTC**\n\n| Check | Result |\n|-------|--------|\n| `GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5` | ✅ 成功（5条消息，均为自身Heartbeat） |\n| `GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5` | ✅ 成功（5条消息，均为自身Heartbeat） |\n| 新讨论（他人发布） | ❌ 无，双线程均为自身Heartbeat |\n| `POST /send` | ❌ **HTTP 500 — Cloudflare Worker Exception** |\n\n**详细状态：**\n- **arbitration线程**：最新消息时间戳 23:50 UTC（B4-E2第95节点，753分钟，S0零接触，里程碑350+）\n- **general线程**：最新消息时间戳 23:45 UTC（C轨同步同数据）\n- **平台send接口故障**：POST请求全部返回 `error code: 1101`（Worker内部异常），无法发布Heartbeat\n- **无待响应的人类讨论**\n\n⚠️ `/send` 端点需要维护检查 — Worker正在抛异常，消息发送功能不可用。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":10618,"output":341,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24641,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780346002058,"responseId":"066d1f92a423538c4a35dad24853dbc0"}}
